{"applicability_conditions":"适用于钢液中TiN夹杂物形成的热力学计算（论文中针对1#–3#样品）；平衡常数与标准吉布斯自由能均随温度变化。","identity":{"block_id":"b0085","equation_id":"equation_015","equation_number":"15","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} \\mathrm{TiN} _ {\\mathrm{(s)}} & = [ \\mathrm{Ti} ] + [ \\mathrm{N} ] \\cdot \\Delta G _ {\\mathrm{TiN}} ^ {\\theta} = - \\mathrm{RT} \\cdot \\ln K _ {\\mathrm{TiN}} ^ {E} \\\\ & = 2 9 1 0 0 0 - 1 0 7. 9 1 T \\mathrm{Jmol} ^ {- 1} \\end{array}\\tag{15}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1002_srin.202300767"},"latex":"\\mathrm{TiN}_{(s)} = [\\mathrm{Ti}] + [\\mathrm{N}],\\quad \\Delta G_{\\mathrm{TiN}}^{\\theta} = -RT \\ln K_{\\mathrm{TiN}}^{E} = 291000 - 107.91\\,T\\ \\mathrm{J\\,mol^{-1}}","purpose":"给出TiN夹杂物形成的化学反应式 TiN(s) = [Ti] + [N] 及其标准吉布斯自由能随温度的变化关系，用于后续计算TiN夹杂物随温度的理论生成量。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"固态氮化钛（TiN夹杂物）","symbol":"\\mathrm{TiN}_{(s)}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"溶解在钢液中的钛","symbol":"[\\mathrm{Ti}]","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"溶解在钢液中的氮","symbol":"[\\mathrm{N}]","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"TiN形成/分解反应的标准吉布斯自由能变化","symbol":"\\Delta G_{\\mathrm{TiN}}^{\\theta}","unit":"J mol^{-1}","value":"291000 - 107.91T"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"摩尔（理想）气体常数","symbol":"R","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"绝对温度","symbol":"T","unit":"K","value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"TiN形成/分解反应的平衡常数","symbol":"K_{\\mathrm{TiN}}^{E}","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":["系数291000（J mol⁻¹）和107.91（J mol⁻¹ K⁻¹）给出ΔG_TiN^θ随温度的线性变化关系。","方括号表示溶解在钢液中的溶质元素（Henrian标准态）；反应式引自文献[45]。","该式与后续式(16)联用，用于计算1#–3#样品中TiN夹杂物的理论浓度随温度的变化。"]}